tion: grab, reload, and shoot with both hands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive combat: dodge, take cover, and engage in close-quarters battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade dynamics: constant action and spectacular shootouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety of weapons: from classic pistols and shotguns to miniguns and rocket launchers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies and bosses: each with unique mechanics requiring different approaches</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized graphics: low-poly style and immersive Wild West atmosphere</p></li></ul>",
